OL,3,GNEWSARed squirrel project opens #250k
OL,4,Acommunity grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FGroups trying to protect red squirrels
OL,7,Fare being invited to bid for funding
OL,8,Ffrom a #250,000 pot.
OL,10,FThe Red Squirrel Recovery Network
OL,11,F(RSRN) said it hoped to "engage people
OL,12,Ffrom all backgrounds" with grants of up
OL,13,Fto #500 available for smaller
OL,14,Factivities to #5,000 to support ideas
OL,15,Fwith a wider reach.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
