OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARed squirrel project opens #250k
OL,4,Acommunity grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project, which started in 2025,
OL,7,Fworks with conservation partners and
OL,8,Fvolunteer groups across Northumberland,
OL,9,FCumbria, Manchester, Lancashire,
OL,10,FMerseyside and southern Scotland to
OL,11,Fraise awareness of the endangered
OL,12,Fspecies.
OL,14,FIn May, animal welfare group Save Our
OL,15,FReds said the species "still clings on"
OL,16,Facross Cumbria, Northumberland and the
OL,17,FNorth Pennines but could disappear
OL,18,Fwithin 25 years.
